  "question": {
    "text": "Tangents are drawn at the end points of a normal chord of the parabola <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></math>. The locus of their point of intersection is"
  },
